1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch3","children":["FOSA丨03丨模块化"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨03丨模块化"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第三章的课后思考题，深入探讨模块化设计的核心概念——连接性（connascence），分析静态与动态连接性的区别、不同连接性形式的强弱程度，以及如何在代码库中合理选择连接性类型，帮助理解高内聚低耦合的实现原理和最佳实践。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-02T11:00:26.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/02"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,323"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第三章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["What is meant by the term ",["$","em","em-0",{"children":"connascence"}],"?"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"\"连接性\"这个术语是什么意思？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between static and dynamic connascence?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"静态连接性和动态连接性有什么区别？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["What does ",["$","em","em-0",{"children":"connascence of type"}]," mean? Is it static or dynamic connascence?"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"类型连接性是什么意思？它是静态的还是动态的？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the strongest form of connascence?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"连接性最强的形式是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the weakest form of connascence?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"连接性最弱的形式是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Which is preferred within a code base—static or dynamic connascence?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在一个代码库中，静态连接性和动态连接性哪个更受青睐？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"本篇的主题是 Modularity（模块化），谈到模块化，我们最常提到的一句话就是：\"高内聚（cohesion）、低耦合（coupling）\"。"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"内聚是指模块内部各元素之间关联的紧密程度。高内聚意味着模块中的所有元素都紧密相关，并且共同为一个单一的、明确定义的目的服务。高内聚使模块的功能职责更加集中和明确，易于理解和修改。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"耦合是指不同模块之间相互依赖的程度。低耦合意味着模块之间的依赖关系很弱，一个模块的改变对其他模块的影响尽可能小。低耦合降低了系统修改、测试和部署的风险。当系统的一个部分发生变化时，由于依赖关系较少，需要修改的其他部分也较少。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"课后题中提到的 connascence（连接性）跟耦合的概念很像。"}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"当一个组件的修改需要修改另外一个组件才能保持系统整体的正确性时，这两个组件就处于连接性状态。它衡量了软件组件之间相互依赖的程度。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"连接性是对耦合度量的一种细化。虽然传统的耦合度量（如内向耦合和外向耦合）关注的是连接的方向，但连接性更进一步，关心组件之间如何耦合在一起。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"连接性可以分为 2 大类："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["静态连接性：指的是源代码级别的耦合，它可以通过简单的源代码分析来确定。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"命名连接性：多个组件必须就某个实体的名称达成一致。这是最弱的连接性形式，也是代码库中最理想的耦合方式，因为现代重构工具可以轻松实现系统范围内的名称更改。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"类型连接性：多个组件必须就某个实体的类型达成一致。这在许多静态类型语言中很常见，例如变量和参数被限制为特定类型。"}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$Lc","\n"]}],"\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13"]}]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]]}]}]
18:I["3c10efde56c2",[],"MarkdownImage",1]
19:I["201d37663261",[],"Webmentions",1]
